<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal credit body accepts no bids for bills.</title>
<headline>Portugal credit body accepts no bids for bills.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's Institute for Public Credit Management (IGCP) accepted no bids at its offer of 15 billion escudos of three-month bills, the Bank of Portugal said.</p>
<p>Bids totalled 30 billion.</p>
<p>At the last such auction on May 22, the Institute placed 19.85 billion at 5.4582 percent.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
